abstract: "A public reproducibility package containing typed boundary data, a field-presence versus exact-typing diagnostic ladder, a claim-indexed comparability graph, partial-identification rules, eligibility-repair and sensitivity analyses, source-visible numerical cases, deterministic figure sources and executable checks for energy comparisons in lunar-regolith construction experiments."
